Fardain, a new land.

00:24:01.120 --> 00:24:05.500
A meeting with a mysterious boy will alter Flit's fate.

00:24:05.500 --> 00:24:08.050
Next time, on Mobile Suit Gundam AGE...

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:13.010
The Demon Boy

00:24:08.050 --> 00:24:09.550
"The Demon Boy."

00:24:09.550 --> 00:24:13.010
Three destinies will form history...
